## Frozen invariants

1. Catalogue = static/silent (215 rows). Exact-name match. **No fuzzy matching.**
2. Hook output shape is final: `{ med, catalogMatch, profileMode, schedule, doseHistory, contextNotes, domainSignals, medsLoading, medNotFound }` (+ log actions).
